INT: What about your religious life? Do you remember the holidays, in particular?

HH: The Jewish holiday?

INT: The Jewish holidays.

HH: Yes, we celebrated all simchas together-- that means Pesach, Shavuot, and Sukkos. And of course, we went to shul on Rosh Hashanah and Yom Kippur. And both my brother and I went to cheder. So we had a Jewish upbringing.

INT: Do you remember the name of the rabbi?

