So then I was sitting-- [PAUSES FOR 3 SECONDS] sheltering on the first floor in-- until it became quiet outside, until all the trucks had left and the SS had stopped shouting and screaming. And then I walked quickly back to my room, where-- and 20 minutes later, the other two boys came. They had also hidden somewhere. And so we were together again, and we celebrated. But it didn't last long. A couple of days later, the SS came specially to take us-- no way to escape.

INT: Were you aware, when you first escaped from the SS, what your fate would have been had you not escaped?

